{
  "_readme": "Skill VFX (presentation only; never read by the battle). ElementDefaults: exactly one effect per Element (None included), used by every skill without an entry of its own. Skills: per-skill effects by skill id (beast skills, avatar actives, enemy-library skills). An effect: Motion Projectile (flies caster -> target over TravelMs, optionally drawing Projectile) or Instant; then at impact, per target: HitStopMs freeze, Flipbook (a pixel-art sheet by sprite Name; frame size must match the manifest), Particles (burst; speeds px/s, Gravity px/s^2, Colors are palette chars), ScreenShake (Amplitude virtual px, DurationMs), HitFlash (palette-char tint on the target), DamageNumber (palette-char colours; rises RisePx over RiseMs). Sheets and palette chars come from content/art/pixel/pixel-art-manifest.json. Ranges and rules: BeastCraft.Vfx.VfxLibraryValidator. Tints multiply, so tinted sheets are drawn white (Tooling/PixelArt).",
